Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: share UAIF0 between dream2lteks capture and Calliope

Route the loudspeaker PCM through Samsung Calliope while keeping the
receiver and microphone native. Hold UAIF0 and ABOX power while either
the microphone or firmware playback uses them. Restore only the
capture-owned field of the shared route register.

Serialize ALSA start, stop and setup against firmware ownership.
Prevent concurrent use of RDMA0 by the receiver and loudspeaker.
Retain power and DMA on a failed firmware shutdown.

